// Title: Suspicious File Created in Outlook Temporary Directory
// Rule ID: fabb0e80-030c-4e3e-a104-d09676991ac3
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1566.001
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_office_outlook_susp_file_creation_in_temp_dir.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
